Alembic migration scripts for agent-mcp.

See agent_mcp/db/README.md for the full workflow. Quick reference:

    alembic revision -m "describe the change"
    # edit migrations/versions/NNNN_describe_the_change.py
    alembic upgrade head     # apply locally
    git commit -a -m "feat: ..."

`alembic upgrade head` also runs automatically on application
startup, so users on existing DBs pick up new migrations the next
time they boot agent-mcp.
